  "content": "<p>这个简单的重纹理模组将 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" rel=\"nofollow\">储物抽屉 (Storage Drawers) 模组</a> 的贴图现代化，使其符合 Jappa 1.14+ 风格的新外观。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持版本</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1.21.1</li>\n<li>1.20.1</li>\n<li>1.19</li>\n<li>1.18</li>\n<li>1.16</li>\n<li>1.12</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fI3I410P9Q1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 请我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"196\" height=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UV0z4K.png\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/anQZraw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"664\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W0cee8j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"664\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0N6x1G1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"664\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iw1MIpK.png\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/blinking-ender-eyes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZniwvvZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"63\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/baby-animals-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2eR3FW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mob-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrkE2a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-halloween-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PwGFKBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-fall-pa